5,1,1,talk,Minako,,"Since our current arrangement is breaking down, we need a factual basis for a new system. I'll look into last year's tax, insurance and parking papers, and the hours of use recorded in the diary.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"To ensure we don't repeat past mistakes, I'll examine what two other car-sharing households said and the spell of checking each other's figures.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I want to know why the car is often unreliable for my morning needs. I'll check the state of the car at handover and the trips that repeat weekly.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,I'll look into last year's fuel receipts and a month's trial of recording every run. We need to know the actual costs and who is really driving.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think I'll look into the weeks of heavy use over the year and the mechanic's remarks at the last service. I want to see how the car is actually being handled.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minako,,"Does anyone have any objections to these choices, or do you feel we've missed any critical data points before we proceed?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"The distribution seems comprehensive. We have covered the financial, behavioral, and mechanical aspects. I believe this will provide a balanced perspective for our decision.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"I agree. As long as we are honest about what we find, this should give us enough information to stop the current chaos.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,I'm not concerned with honesty as much as accuracy. Let's just make sure we don't gloss over the numbers when we report back.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I'll do my best to be accurate. I just hope we can find a way to make this work without too much arguing.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minako,,"Since we are all in agreement, I suggest we move forward with our research. Let's each take the time to gather the information we've selected.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,A sensible plan. I shall begin my inquiries immediately so we can return to the table with a clearer understanding of the social dynamics at play.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I'll start my search as well. I'm particularly interested in seeing if the handover issues are as frequent as they feel.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,I'll get to the receipts. It's better to have the hard data in front of us than to rely on anyone's memory of who paid for what.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll go check the mechanic's notes and the heavy use periods. I hope it helps us find a smoother way to share.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minako,,I believe we have a solid plan. Let's conclude this round and proceed to gather our respective data. I look forward to seeing what we discover.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. Let us disperse and return once we have the facts. I suspect the results will be quite illuminating for all of us.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I'm ready. Let's just make sure we all stick to the list we agreed upon so we don't miss anything.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shion,,"Don't worry, Asuka. I have no intention of deviating from the list. The data will speak for itself.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,Me too. I'll go now and see what I can find.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
